      "default": "Write the manual once. It downloads as one HTML file that opens from a USB stick, prints to PDF, and publishes to a read-only page on this portal that anybody can open without a login."
    },
    {
      "name": "manuals",
      "type": "text",
      "default": "Manuals"
    },
    {
